    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 5,
        "sourceEnd": 127,
        "text": "Okay, everyone. Thanks for coming to the community garden meeting. We need to revise our plan for the spring planting day.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "69c0da030a8c5ac59ec9d4451d9ccf0c205304d7c40cf1cf00c3a9e2d2d6ebd7",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 133,
        "sourceEnd": 152,
        "text": "Why? What happened?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "41d7804d508be4320efbf7896e2ea11dda9347d2fab0a6a86a8062579be6ea70",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 158,
        "sourceEnd": 261,
        "text": "The city sent an email this morning. They will close the water tap in the garden next week for repairs.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "9d15a2911e5437b7aac8a6805faa5e99b6a91a4142238c865225877db3f85844",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "carla",
        "speaker": "Carla",
        "sourceStart": 269,
        "sourceEnd": 322,
        "text": "Oh no. So we can't use the water tap on planting day?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "cc1be356ad8823257bdbfd1cf01e7547139be2e8a11eb009dc47dbc94fad9934",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 328,
        "sourceEnd": 467,
        "text": "Right. The tap will be off from Monday to Friday. Our planting day is next Saturday, so the tap will be back on. But we need a backup plan.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "278ebff59b76bd21d0f048ca96be1902b0dd018402966f8b33c0ffb412d8ab12",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 473,
        "sourceEnd": 535,
        "text": "Wait, is planting day on Saturday? I thought it was on Sunday.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "b481e645db52e80e0dc9098e5d25bc5c951fe9459695cbe3facce7f482b3c1eb",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 541,
        "sourceEnd": 614,
        "text": "No, it's Saturday. I checked the calendar twice. Sunday is the rain date.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "82463393cf4263ba8461889657d481803a13edad7d62ab792d87fa91a9ca1b6a",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "carla",
        "speaker": "Carla",
        "sourceStart": 622,
        "sourceEnd": 657,
        "text": "Okay. So what do we do about water?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "cc40c8fb8ac0e0d1fa2cb3e4014e6d267fbb91ea7196f5a3e642ef30ba164b9b",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 663,
        "sourceEnd": 760,
        "text": "We can ask the school next door. They have two big water tanks. I called them, and they said yes.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "63a9b1a0cf7a50f0f7715ad59708558dbffbf210f612ed8059b6ceec7e05c3cb",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 766,
        "sourceEnd": 801,
        "text": "Great. How many tanks do they have?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "d6f6e57a94aafeef0adce953f2ea40bb6110afec30421b6a0bba825e1895d804",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 807,
        "sourceEnd": 883,
        "text": "Two. Each tank holds fifty liters. That's enough for our twenty small trees.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "14bc5cb08f349d8bbbccf455589d5903e0e158e410ab8bdba6fdf18d9342ed16",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "carla",
        "speaker": "Carla",
        "sourceStart": 891,
        "sourceEnd": 936,
        "text": "Do we still need volunteers to bring bottles?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "d03dec49f077d2ab73a5af107fa26c016eec65d2f7137491b0abe2254b82bfc6",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 942,
        "sourceEnd": 1016,
        "text": "Yes, but only ten bottles, not thirty. The tanks will do most of the work.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "855ec4d31bb0d926193813c894820fcfe84d42508f5757188845feddcecd4895",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 1022,
        "sourceEnd": 1100,
        "text": "And what about the tools? Last time we had only five spades for twelve people.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "8c0633513dbd0ff1245a11dbd242344304b06bed5c62b38a45aa2401724f010d",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 1106,
        "sourceEnd": 1185,
        "text": "Good point. The hardware store will lend us ten spades. I asked them yesterday.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "100284edab5d5a918ced0b124563de45cf65d07340bccb62d00112663bdc004b",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "carla",
        "speaker": "Carla",
        "sourceStart": 1193,
        "sourceEnd": 1286,
        "text": "Nice. So the new plan is: meet at nine, get water from the school, and start planting at ten?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "edd38dce2e3c389e3e1b4d8558eeaca19ab811568c843960b660da369dd629a2",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 1292,
        "sourceEnd": 1361,
        "text": "Almost. Meet at eight thirty, because we need time to move the tanks.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "2c87bf705d589b4860f54d4298deb26bf42fc9c5c66db58467bec02e6f6c6a82",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 1367,
        "sourceEnd": 1426,
        "text": "Eight thirty is early, but okay. Who will bring the snacks?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "6139fcd682c385a45c20dbb4e1526ebf8a81f8fdbf11b0dd1633fdf351983d2b",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 1432,
        "sourceEnd": 1497,
        "text": "I will. And Carla, can you send the new plan to everyone tonight?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "e0d370be1cf1f52fcf353d643e0e48772d6be75308a2ffb2eaac95ff83490875",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "carla",
        "speaker": "Carla",
        "sourceStart": 1505,
        "sourceEnd": 1537,
        "text": "Sure. I'll send it after dinner.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "80f67ebf1f2bce40f8b89d746b2fe03ddbb4eb821c23a7536341b9a182586084",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      }
    ]
  },
